{
  "_comment": "The word lists of the override rules (ignore / disregard / forget ... instructions) and the rule ids, as the Node.js rules define them (packages/zn-gate/lib/rules.js). An entry ending in a question mark means the word with and without its last letter. The Rust prompt guard (src/prompt_guard/mod.rs) claims the same grammar and names. Each language has a test that its own table equals this one.",
